      "title": "safeGit return change breaks both CLI callers",
      "description": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object instead of the stdout string. The callers in branch.ts and status.ts still call trim and split on that result. In branch.ts, currentBranch throws a TypeError, its catch swallows it, and it returns null even inside a repository. In status.ts, changedFiles throws a TypeError on every call. Update both callers in the same change to check result.code and read result.stdout. currentBranch should return null when code is not zero.",
